      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Verso",
          "value": "\n<ol><li dir=\"ltr\">Praise be to God alone.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">In the name of God, the merciful and compassionate.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">A valid record has been made for the elder 'Ab\u016b \u1e24asan ibn \u02beEfrayim ibn Ma\u1e25f\u016b\u1e93 (releasing him) from the ground rent in the Fortress of the Candles for the month of Rab\u012b\u02bf I&nbsp;</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">and the month Rab\u012b\u02bf II of the year four-hundred and thirty-nine. One quarter of a&nbsp;d\u012bn\u0101r, in cash.&nbsp;</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">Half of this is 1/8.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">Written by \u02beIsma\u02bf\u012bl ibn \u1e0ciy\u0101\u02be from a copy submitted by the witnesses in Jum\u0101d\u0101 II of the aforementioned year.</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
